<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>PlanetBintang News AI</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/app.css"></head><body><header><b>✦ PlanetBintang <span>News AI</span></b><nav><a href="#news">Berita</a><a href="#briefing">AI Briefing</a><a href="#topics">Topik</a></nav><button id="theme">◐ Tema</button></header><section class="hero"><p>NEWSROOM • INTELLIGENCE MODE</p><h1>Berita hari ini,<br><em>lebih mudah dipahami.</em></h1><p>Jelajahi topik dan ringkas teks berita. Verifikasi selalu ke sumber asli.</p><form id="search"><input id="query" placeholder="Cari berita atau topik…"><button>Cari</button></form></section><main><section id="briefing"><div><small>AI DAILY BRIEFING</small><h2>Mulai dari gambaran besar</h2><p>Ringkasan lokal untuk teks yang Anda masukkan; belum terhubung ke layanan AI eksternal.</p></div><div class="tool"><textarea id="sourceText" placeholder="Tempel teks berita…"></textarea><button id="summarize">Ringkas teks</button><p id="summary" aria-live="polite"></p></div></section><section id="news"><h2>Jelajahi berita</h2><select id="category"><option>Semua</option><option>Teknologi</option><option>Indonesia</option><option>Bisnis</option><option>Sains</option><option>Dunia</option></select><div id="grid" class="grid"></div><p class="note">Kartu contoh — bukan berita real-time.</p></section><section id="topics"><h2>Topik pilihan</h2><div class="topics"><button data-cat="Teknologi">Teknologi</button><button data-cat="Indonesia">Indonesia</button><button data-cat="Bisnis">Bisnis</button><button data-cat="Sains">Sains</button></div></section></main><footer>PlanetBintang News AI · Verifikasi sumber sebelum membagikan.</footer><script type="module" src="assets/js/app.js"></script></body></html>